Third-party notices
===================

The following files of this crate contain declarations (function
prototypes, structure layouts, constant values, error-code names and
descriptions, and the DER-to-errno mapping) transcribed from the public
headers of DAOS (https://github.com/daos-stack/daos), tag v2.8.1:

  src/sys/mod.rs
  src/sys/api.rs
  src/sys/lib_dfs.rs
  src/der_table.rs
  src/error.rs (DerCode::to_errno)
  src/obj/oid.rs, src/obj/io.rs (object id layout, object types and
    classes, conditional flags)
  src/cont/create.rs, src/cont/prop.rs (property types and values)
  src/array.rs, src/kv.rs (array and key-value declarations)
  abi/prototypes.txt, abi/symbols.txt
  abi/layout-*.txt and abi/der2errno-*.txt (generated from those headers)
  tests/mock/libdfs_mock.c
  tests/mock/libdaos_mock.c (prototypes and structures of the pool,
    container, object, key-value, array and transaction calls)

